{{Term/Store|Topaz Earrings|Topaz Earrings|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
Topaz Earrings are a type of [[Accessory]], specifically being [[Earring]]s that can be clipped onto [[Link]]'s ears.<ref name="BotW Book"/> They can be purchased at the [[Starlight Memories]] [[Jewelry Shop]] in [[Gerudo Town]] for 500 [[Rupee]]s and five [[Topaz]]es.<ref name="BotW Isha"/> Alternatively, at the end of the "[[Tools of the Trade]]" [[Side Quest]], one of the Accessories that [[Isha]] offers Link as a reward are the Topaz Earrings.<ref name="BotW Isha 2"/><ref name="BotW Isha 3"/> When worn, Topaz Earrings provide Link with one level of [[Shock Resistance]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They also provide the hidden [[Added Effect]] [[Ancient Pow Up]], increasing damage done by [[Ancient Soldier Gear]] and [[Guardian Gear]] by 20%.

Topaz Earrings can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]. However, they cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

